  "changes_data": [
    {
      "diff": "@@ -687,7 +687,7 @@ Note: You should have successfully built Wireshark\n before doing the following.\n \n If you want to build your own\n-_Wireshark-win64-{wireshark-version}-myprotocol123.exe_, you'll need\n+_Wireshark-{wireshark-version}-myprotocol123-x64.exe_, you'll need\n NSIS. You can download it from http://nsis.sourceforge.net[].\n \n Note that the 32-bit version of NSIS will work for both 64-bit and 32-bit versions of Wireshark.\n@@ -706,7 +706,7 @@ If you sign your executables you should do so between the “wireshark_nsis_prep\n Run\n \n ----\n-packaging\\nsis\\wireshark-win64-{wireshark-version}-myprotocol123.exe\n+packaging\\nsis\\wireshark-{wireshark-version}-myprotocol123-x64.exe\n ----\n \n to test your new installer.\n",
      "collapsed": false,
      "too_large": false,
      "new_path": "docbook/wsdg_src/wsdg_quick_setup.adoc",
      "old_path": "docbook/wsdg_src/wsdg_quick_setup.adoc",
      "a_mode": "100644",
      "b_mode": "100644",
      "new_file": false,
      "renamed_file": false,
      "deleted_file": false,
      "generated_file": null
    },
    {
      "diff": "@@ -978,7 +978,7 @@ installation should be straightforward.\n === Windows: NSIS (Optional)\n \n The NSIS (Nullsoft Scriptable Install System) is used to generate\n-_Wireshark-win64-{wireshark-version}.exe_ from all the files\n+_Wireshark-{wireshark-version}-x64.exe_ from all the files\n needed to be installed, including all required DLLs, plugins, and supporting\n files.\n \n",
      "collapsed": false,
      "too_large": false,
      "new_path": "docbook/wsdg_src/wsdg_tools.adoc",
      "old_path": "docbook/wsdg_src/wsdg_tools.adoc",
      "a_mode": "100644",
      "b_mode": "100644",
      "new_file": false,
      "renamed_file": false,
      "deleted_file": false,
      "generated_file": null
    },
    {
      "diff": "@@ -48,8 +48,8 @@ Select the package most appropriate for your system.\n === Installing Wireshark under Windows\n \n The official Windows packages can be downloaded from the Wireshark {wireshark-main-url}[main page] or the {wireshark-download-url}[download page].\n-Installer names contain the platform and version.\n-For example, Wireshark-win64-{wireshark-version}.exe installs Wireshark {wireshark-version} for 64-bit Windows.\n+Installer names contain the version and platform.\n+For example, Wireshark-{wireshark-version}-x64.exe installs Wireshark {wireshark-version} for Windows on 64-bit Intel processors.\n The Wireshark installer includes Npcap which is required for packet capture.\n Windows packages automatically update.\n See <<ChBuildInstallUpdatingWireshark>> for details.\n@@ -200,9 +200,9 @@ The following extcap binaries are supported.\n \n Example:\n ----\n-> Wireshark-win64-wireshark-2.0.5.exe /NCRC /S /desktopicon=yes /quicklaunchicon=no /D=C:\\Program Files\\Foo\n+> Wireshark-4.2.5-x64.exe /NCRC /S /desktopicon=yes /quicklaunchicon=no /D=C:\\Program Files\\Foo\n \n-> Wireshark-win64-3.3.0.exe /S /EXTRACOMPONENTS=sshdump,udpdump\n+> Wireshark-4.2.5-x64.exe /S /EXTRACOMPONENTS=sshdump,udpdump\n ----\n \n Running the installer without any parameters shows the normal interactive installer.\n",
      "collapsed": false,
      "too_large": false,
      "new_path": "docbook/wsug_src/wsug_build_install.adoc",
      "old_path": "docbook/wsug_src/wsug_build_install.adoc",
      "a_mode": "100644",
      "b_mode": "100644",
      "new_file": false,
      "renamed_file": false,
      "deleted_file": false,
      "generated_file": null
    },
    {
      "diff": "@@ -376,7 +376,7 @@ Windows x64 Package:\n   extends: .build-windows\n   rules: !reference [.if-w-w-only-merged]\n   tags:\n-    - wireshark-win64-package\n+    - wireshark-x64-package\n   before_script:\n     - $env:WIRESHARK_BASE_DIR = \"C:\\Development\"\n     - $env:Configuration = \"RelWithDebInfo\"\n",
      "collapsed": false,
